This is DiskMap, an open-source native macOS disk-space analyzer aimed at
matching/beating DiskBuddy. Full context lives in `AGENTS.md` at the repo
root — read it before making changes if you haven't already this session.

Hard rules, repeated here because they matter most:
- Never delete files directly. Everything routes through
  `CleanupQueue.commit()` (moves to Trash via `FileManager.trashItem`).
- No networking, anywhere. This app is offline-only by design.
- Run `swift test` after every change. Don't report a task as done with
  failing or unrun tests.
- `CloneDetector.swift` is verified (TASK-005). `SquarifiedTreemap.swift`
  is verified (TASK-001). Don't build on a file that still says
  `UNVERIFIED` in its header.
